  <reason>Subject and account: The subject of this report is Danish Shah, holder of account PK**ABPA****4080, opened on 31 May 2025. The customer's declared occupation is medical sales officer (salaried), with a declared income of PKR 120,000 per month.

Activity summary: During the period 3 July 2026 to 27 July 2026, the account recorded 16 credits totalling PKR 23,102,000 as well as 5 debits totalling PKR 18,700,000. The credits included 15 cash deposits totalling PKR 22,982,000, made over the counter at 3 branches (Clifton Branch, DHA Phase 6 Branch, Gulshan-e-Iqbal Branch). The activity was detected on 27 July 2026, when Tazama typology STR-PK-01 scored 320 against an alert threshold of 300.

Grounds for suspicion: 10 of 15 cash deposits (67%) were between PKR 1,600,000 and PKR 1,999,999, totalling PKR 17,926,000, just below the cash transaction reporting threshold of PKR 2,000,000. The cash was deposited across 3 branches (Clifton Branch, DHA Phase 6 Branch, Gulshan-e-Iqbal Branch) rather than at a single branch. Credits in the activity window were 192.5 times the declared monthly income, against a declared income of PKR 120,000 per month. Taken together, these indicators are consistent with suspected structuring; the reporting entity has not established the underlying offence.

Flow of funds: Of the outgoing funds, PKR 7,045,000 was sent to Sheraz Traders (PK**SHER****1518, Synthetic Bank C) in 2 transactions. Of the outgoing funds, PKR 6,936,000 was sent to Al-Noor Exchange Company (PK**AL-N****1888, Synthetic Bank C) in 2 transactions. Of the outgoing funds, PKR 4,719,000 was sent to Crescent Imports (PK**CRES****1592, Synthetic Bank B) in 1 transaction. Funds did not remain in the account: debits equal to 81% of credits, with a median of 23.9 hours between the latest credit and each debit.

Other considerations: Screening of the subject returned no match on sanctions, PEP or adverse-media screening on 30 July 2026.

Action taken by the reporting entity: Action taken: a note by L2 analyst (30 July 2026): "Account placed under enhanced monitoring pending the reporting decision. No contact made with the customer about this review."</reason>
